  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/03/P1500165.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(28 fotos) El pub Flamenkito, en la avenida Pa&iacute;s Valenci&agrave;, 110 de Onda, ha acogido la noche y madrugada del viernes al s&aacute;bado un marat&oacute;n de sevillanas en el que han podido bailar todas aquellas personas que lo han deseado.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/03/P1500176.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Al mismo tiempo han podido degustar el gin preparado especialmente para la ruta Love Tonic de Hosturionda, con ginebra Plymooth y t&oacute;nica Schweppes especial.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/flamenkitomaratosevillanesgintonic/p1500155.jpg\" alt=\"p1500155\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/flamenkitomaratosevillanesgintonic/p1500161.jpg\" alt=\"p1500161\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/flamenkitomaratosevillanesgintonic/p1500162.jpg\" alt=\"p1500162\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/flamenkitomaratosevillanesgintonic/p1500164.jpg\" alt=\"p1500164\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/flamenkitomaratosevillanesgintonic/p1500165.jpg\" alt=\"p1500165\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/flamenkitomaratosevillanesgintonic/p1500166.jpg\" alt=\"p1500166\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/flamenkitomaratosevillanesgintonic/p1500171.jpg\" alt=\"p1500171\" style=\"max-width:100%;heig